  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>hydroquinine</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>M09AA01</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>van Kan HJ et al. 2000</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>adult patients with muscle cramps</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>hydroquinine</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_hydroquinine/Hydroquinine_van2000_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>elimination half-life</td><td>10.9</td><td>h</td><td><small>t1/2z</small></td></tr><tr><td>distribution volume</td><td>1.24</td><td>l/kg</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr><tr><td>total clearance</td><td>6.7</td><td>l/h</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr></table><h4>About hydroquinine</h4><p>Hydroquinine, a quinine derivative, is classified among drugs for disorders of the musculo-skeletal system. It is not an established marketed medicine; it is listed only as an experimental compound, so its current clinical use is unclear.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q5276450\">Wikidata Q5276450</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Hydroquinine\">Hydroquinine</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>van Kan HJ et al. (2000). Hydroquinine pharmacokinetics after oral administration in adult patients with muscle cramps. <i>European journal of clinical pharmacology 56(3):263–267</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s002280000128\">10.1007/s002280000128</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/10952483\">10952483</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from van_2000: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
